---
manual: styles.state.disabled
lines: [1417, 1421]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: G4
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 200 do
  @line = edit_line text: "fixed", state: "disabled"
end
----------- test code
line = edit_line("@line")
click_on line
type_text "changed"

assert_equal "fixed", line.text, "a disabled edit_line cannot be edited"
refute_equal line.linkable_id, focused_drawable&.linkable_id, "and does not even take focus"
